# Pagecord

> Make yourself a home on the web.

Pagecord is a personal site and blog for writers. Focus on writing, not wrangling. It's independent, bootstrapped and open source, made in Edinburgh. Publish when you like, from wherever you like: the built-in editor, iA Writer, Obsidian, or just by sending an email. Tinkerers can use Shortcuts, scripts, the API and CLI too. Readers can follow by RSS or email. The free Classic plan includes unlimited posts and pages, themes, search, tags, RSS, full export and 20 hosted uploads (images and audio). Every new account starts with a 14-day free trial of Premium, which adds a much bigger upload allowance including video, custom domains, email subscribers, comments, analytics, a contact form, Obsidian, API, CLI, and more. Nothing you make is ever taken away if you stop paying.

## Features
- Post by email (forward or compose to your blog)
- Rich text editor with images, tables, code blocks
- Obsidian, API, and CLI publishing
- Custom home page
- Unlimited pages (about, contact, archives, galleries)
- Password-protected blogs
- Embeddable contact form
- Up to three blogs from one account (Premium)
- Blog interface in English, French, Spanish, German and Portuguese
- Themes, colours, fonts, layouts and custom CSS
- Tags and RSS feeds
- Email newsletter (weekly digest or per-post delivery to subscribers)
- Privacy-respecting analytics
- Custom domains
- Custom code (your own HTML in the head and body of every page, on Premium)
- Comments (no reader account needed, held for approval, spam filtered)
- Reply by email (readers can respond to posts)
- Full site HTML export
- Dynamic open graph images

